{"id":"d34cdb12ee59812c","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-ax-sep.md","title":"Axiom Schema of Separation","display":"ax-sep — Axiom Schema of Separation","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-ax-sep","aliases":["58-ax-sep"],"display":"ax-sep — Axiom Schema of Separation","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-ax-sep"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-ax-sep</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-sep — Axiom Schema of Separation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(v_0,v_1,\\ldots,v_n)\">\\(\\varphi(v_0,v_1,\\ldots,v_n)\\)</span> is a metalinguistic formula of the language of membership whose free variable symbols are contained in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{v_0,v_1,\\ldots,v_n\\}\">\\(\\{v_0,v_1,\\ldots,v_n\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> is the distinguished separation variable; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_1,\\ldots,p_n\">\\(p_1,\\ldots,p_n\\)</span> are the corresponding object-language parameter positions</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}sep}[\\varphi,n]\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\forall p_1\\cdots\\forall p_n\\;\\forall A\\;\\exists B\\;\\forall x\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in B\\leftrightarrow(x\\in A\\land\\varphi(x,p_1,\\ldots,p_n))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}sep}[\\varphi,n]\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\forall p_1\\cdots\\forall p_n\\;\\forall A\\;\\exists B\\;\\forall x\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in B\\leftrightarrow(x\\in A\\land\\varphi(x,p_1,\\ldots,p_n))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The brackets mark genuine metalinguistic schema indexing.  The variable symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span> indexing the schema are not identified with the set parameters <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i\">\\(p_i\\)</span> substituted into the resulting axiom instance.</li>\n<li>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span>, the initial block of parameter quantifiers is empty.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(v_0,v_1,\\ldots,v_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{v_0,v_1,\\ldots,v_n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"v_0","display":false},{"tex":"p_1,\\ldots,p_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}sep}[\\varphi,n]\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\forall p_1\\cdots\\forall p_n\\;\\forall A\\;\\exists B\\;\\forall x\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in B\\leftrightarrow(x\\in A\\land\\varphi(x,p_1,\\ldots,p_n))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"v_i","display":false},{"tex":"p_i","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false}],"bytes":1023,"backlinks":[{"id":"9383dea3f035e8ed","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da27abf5af2ad534","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0b8de0824384672e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"56a77f22c960a56e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-ax-sep.md|58-ax-sep]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing"